Often a pet will sell sooner if someone takes pity on it.

00:33:13.380 --> 00:33:27.780
Pet?

00:33:30.120 --> 00:33:48.850
I could feel them with my mind.

00:33:48.850 --> 00:33:55.600
I didn't want to tell you bad news.

00:34:01.150 --> 00:34:08.000
do you mind sam it looks like we're being sold or something

00:34:08.000 --> 00:34:15.020
wish i was back in the seventh racing jail

00:34:15.020 --> 00:34:28.900
often tried to make the ship do what i want but it never worked

00:34:48.970 --> 00:34:53.460
I think with Lalia's help, I can control it.

00:35:02.780 --> 00:35:15.810
You're not really going to sell us to that thing, are you?

00:35:16.830 --> 00:35:18.800
He's only a dealer.

00:35:19.330 --> 00:35:22.310
He will soon sell you to someone who will look after you.

00:35:23.320 --> 00:35:27.490
I'm not being sold like some animal.

00:35:28.650 --> 00:35:29.800
But you are.

00:35:30.570 --> 00:35:39.640
not me Buster I'm hey what are you

00:35:39.640 --> 00:35:43.090
doing to him boy get into the cage with

00:35:43.090 --> 00:35:45.650
him I do not wish to make you feel pain

00:35:45.650 --> 00:35:59.120
that's better

00:36:01.500 --> 00:36:06.690
Your dog does not matter.

00:36:06.690 --> 00:36:08.610
It is of no value.

00:36:08.610 --> 00:36:12.500
It is you who are valuable.

00:36:16.740 --> 00:36:25.180
We can feel it.

00:36:25.180 --> 00:36:26.180
We can feel the ship.

00:36:26.180 --> 00:36:28.600
Like it was a part of us.

00:36:28.600 --> 00:36:29.480
It's weird.

00:36:29.480 --> 00:36:30.000
Watch.

00:36:39.240 --> 00:36:59.640
stop it you'll just give us away all right outside

00:37:03.320 --> 00:37:06.960
The Shandrilla took him with Kevin and Sam.

00:37:06.960 --> 00:37:08.490
Can you let me out?

00:37:08.490 --> 00:37:10.010
Maybe I can get him for you.

00:37:10.010 --> 00:37:11.990
No, he's my dog. I'll get him.

00:37:11.990 --> 00:37:14.630
But you have to stay here and control the ship.

00:37:38.800 --> 00:37:39.320
I'm going to go.

00:38:00.000 --> 00:38:12.900
see ya. If only you could talk, huh? But she can talk. To me, Amber knows where they are.

00:38:12.900 --> 00:38:16.710
She saw Kevin and Sam being put into a cage.

00:38:30.160 --> 00:38:41.530
Don't worry, Kevin. I can pick any lock on Earth.

00:38:41.530 --> 00:38:44.560
Sam, this isn't Earth.

00:39:03.870 --> 00:39:04.840
What about him?

00:39:04.840 --> 00:39:05.850
We found him.

00:39:05.850 --> 00:39:10.500
Listen, I've been in enough jail cells to know how he feels, a poor little devil.

00:39:59.240 --> 00:39:59.860
They missed it.

00:41:26.330 --> 00:41:27.170
Are you crazy?

00:41:27.170 --> 00:41:29.730
You'll make us crash.

00:42:33.520 --> 00:42:36.210
Hey, this kid is a real devil in a fight.

00:43:32.590 --> 00:43:33.840
Way to go, Captain.

00:43:33.840 --> 00:43:36.370
Captain, huh?

00:43:36.370 --> 00:43:40.690
Why not?

00:43:40.690 --> 00:43:47.440
Well, how do you like it?

00:43:47.440 --> 00:43:52.020
Very dashing.

00:43:52.020 --> 00:43:53.920
What is that?

00:43:53.920 --> 00:43:55.830
It's my space commander uniform.

00:43:55.830 --> 00:43:57.220
Pretty neat, huh?

00:43:57.220 --> 00:43:59.920
Space commander, eh? More like a space cadet.

00:44:00.090 --> 00:44:00.580
Mm-hmm.

00:44:35.440 --> 00:44:36.740
There's something following us.

00:44:37.160 --> 00:44:37.670
Where?

00:44:38.440 --> 00:44:39.470
That thing, where?

00:44:39.980 --> 00:44:41.080
What is it?

00:44:41.890 --> 00:44:42.670
I don't know.

00:44:43.150 --> 00:44:44.910
But whatever it is, it's gaining.

00:44:45.520 --> 00:44:46.040
Fast.

00:44:46.710 --> 00:45:00.000
It wasn't going to be that simple to get away.

00:45:02.080 --> 00:45:10.690
It doesn't look very friendly.

00:45:10.690 --> 00:45:22.310
It's shooting at us.

00:45:22.310 --> 00:45:24.840
Some kind of laser ray, I think.

00:45:44.360 --> 00:45:46.040
keep dodging it forever.

00:46:00.000 --> 00:46:30.000
back at it or something I can't this ship has no weapons terrific if they could fire

00:46:30.160 --> 00:46:31.440
us through a black hole.

00:46:31.960 --> 00:46:34.260
A black hole? Are you crazy, Alistair?

00:46:34.260 --> 00:46:36.400
You can't fly this thing through a black hole.

00:46:40.310 --> 00:46:47.910
Try the black hole, or do we wait for them

00:46:47.910 --> 00:46:49.410
to hit us and catch us again?

00:46:50.310 --> 00:46:51.920
Well, if you can do it,

00:49:16.410 --> 00:49:19.630
At least we're still alive.

00:49:19.630 --> 00:49:22.400
- All right, Alistair.

00:49:22.400 --> 00:49:23.970
- Alistair, are you okay?

00:49:39.440 --> 00:49:40.760
Alistair, are you okay?

00:49:40.980 --> 00:49:41.760
I think so.

00:49:42.340 --> 00:49:44.020
I think you're wonderful.

00:49:44.960 --> 00:49:45.760
Hey, wait a minute.

00:49:46.030 --> 00:49:47.620
What happened to that other ship?

00:49:48.460 --> 00:49:50.260
They followed us into the black hole.

00:49:50.660 --> 00:49:51.880
There's no sign of them now.

00:49:52.630 --> 00:49:54.650
But I don't think they followed us out.

00:49:56.120 --> 00:49:57.140
We're safe now!

00:49:58.530 --> 00:50:00.000
But Alistair,

00:50:00.000 --> 00:50:02.460
Do you think he can fly this thing back home to Earth?

00:50:02.460 --> 00:50:05.080
Look!

00:50:05.080 --> 00:50:07.990
It could be it!

00:50:07.990 --> 00:50:09.740
You didn't cap!

00:50:09.740 --> 00:50:10.660
Well done, Alistair!

00:50:10.660 --> 00:50:12.660
I can't believe it!

00:50:12.660 --> 00:50:30.000
What if it isn't our Earth?

00:50:30.000 --> 00:50:31.930
- What do you mean it isn't our Earth?

00:50:31.930 --> 00:50:34.800
It's gotta be, doesn't it?
